📗
  Checks that serving requests does not grow the process. The compiler and the
  standard library leak in ways that are easy to trip over (the README's
  gotchas list them), and a server that leaks per request dies of it. Every
  kind of conversation the engine can have gets played here, the refused ones
  above all: those run the early exits, which is where the leaks were.
📗
